
## Internationalization

The API supports content negotiation via the `Accept-Language` header. Error messages and translatable content will be returned in the requested language when available.

### Supported Languages
{% for lang in languages %}
- `{{ lang.code }}` - {{ lang.name }}{% if lang.default %} (default){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

### Usage
Include the `Accept-Language` header in your requests:
```
Accept-Language: fr
```

The API follows standard HTTP content negotiation, so you can also specify quality values:
```
Accept-Language: fr-FR, fr;q=0.9, en;q=0.8
```
